# Filament 5

- Library and gallery resources/pages only via `VmediaPlugin`.
- Companion forms: `VmediaFileUpload` (not Spatie `SpatieMediaLibraryFileUpload`).
- Forms: `Filament\Forms\*`; layout: `Filament\Schemas\*`; actions: `Filament\Actions\*`.
- Default gallery rules are product invariants — enforce in policies and actions.
- Bulk gallery assign/replace should reuse `MediaLibrary` helpers, not raw pivots in UI code.
